  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Lobster Sushi.png|200px|left|Lobster sushi]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 59\n |price = 1 to 637\n |time = 1 h\n |source = {{Infoicon|sushib|bigger|link=Sushi Bar}}\n |xp = 76\n |base = 177\n |dia = 4\n |time3 = 51 min\n}}\n'''Lobster sushi''' are [[products]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 59.\n\nLike all [[products]], they are stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making lobster sushi'''===\n[[File:Sushi Bar.png|150px|left|Sushi Bar]]\nLobster sushi are made in the [[Sushi Bar]].\n\nTo make a sushi, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Lobster Tail.png|75px|link=Lobster Tail|Lobster tail]]\n|[[File:Rice.png|75px|link=Rice|Rice]]\n|[[File:Soy Sauce.png|75px|link=Soy Sauce|Soy sauce]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x15'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 1 hour to make a sushi, and 51 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] bar. Each sushi gives players 76 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling lobster sushi'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside Shop]]\n* They can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 6,372 {{Infoicon|coin}} for ten pieces.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make a sushi costs 625 {{Infoicon|coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 1 sushi per crate, up to a total of 4 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n* Making [[Soy Sauce|soy sauce]] takes much longer than making sushi does: 3 hours or 2 hours and 33 minutes in a mastered saucer.\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Hummersushi\n|es = Sushi de langosta\n|fr = Sushi au Homard\n|it = Sushi di aragosta\n|nl = Sushi met Kreeft\n|no = Hummersushi\n|vi = Sushi Tôm hùm\n|zh = Lobster Sushi\n}}\n[[pt-br:Sushi de lagosta]]\n[[ru:Суши с раком]]\n\n[[Category:Sushi Bar Products]]\n[[Category:Lobster Tail Products]]\n[[Category:Soy Sauce Products]]\n[[Category:Rice Products]]",
